---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/resume';
import { url } from '../data/url';
---
<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Crumbles online and Matt in real life. I'm a {profile.title.toLowerCase()} focused on application security:
    validating and triaging vulnerabilities across web, API and mobile targets, and helping people understand
    what a finding actually means and how to fix it.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site is my portfolio and lab notebook. It holds my{' '}
    <a href={url('/web-app-security/')}>web app security writeups</a>, and it's growing to include hardware
    hacking projects and photography.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can see my background on the <a href={url('/resume/')}>resume page</a>, or reach me through{' '}
    <a href={profile.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>, <a href={profile.github}>GitHub</a> or <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>email</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="crumbs">Everyone has a blog, bud. This one is mine.</p>
</Base>
